{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","inLanguage":"en-US","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"💻 Is Roomnix cloud-based?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Roomnix is 100% cloud-based. No installation required - just log in and manage your property from anywhere."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"🔐 Is my property data secure?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. We use encrypted data storage and follow best practices to ensure all hotel and guest data is secure and GDPR/KVKK-compliant."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"🔁 Can I migrate from my current system without losing data?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We provide full migration assistance and securely transfer your rooms, bookings, rates and customer records. No downtime or data loss - we handle everything for you."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"🎁 Is there a free trial or demo?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! You can try Roomnix immediately via our live demo. We also offer a one-year free pilot program for qualified hotels, with no credit card required."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"🛠️ What kind of support does Roomnix offer?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our support team is available 7 days a week via WhatsApp, email and live assistance. We also provide onboarding support and training resources."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"🏕️ Does Roomnix support only hotels?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Roomnix supports hotels, hostels, villas, apartments, camping sites, glamping resorts, and caravan/RV parks. You can manage rooms, beds, units, or pitches depending on your property type."}}]}</script>

