        </div>
        <div class="channel-logo-pill">
          <img src="/images/channel-logos/expedia.svg" alt="Expedia" class="channel-logo-img">
        </div>
        <div class="channel-logo-pill">
          <img src="/images/channel-logos/google-hotel-ads.svg" alt="Google Hotel Ads" class="channel-logo-img">
        </div>
        <div class="channel-logo-pill">
          <img src="/images/channel-logos/agoda.svg" alt="Agoda" class="channel-logo-img">
        </div>
        <div class="channel-logo-pill">
          <img src="/images/channel-logos/tripadvisor.svg" alt="TripAdvisor" class="channel-logo-img">
        </div>
        <!-- +50 more badge -->
        <div class="channel-logo-pill d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center px-3" style="min-width:80px;background:var(--bs-primary,#0d6efd);border-color:transparent;">
          <span class="fw-bold text-white" style="font-size:.85rem;white-space:nowrap;">+50 more</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Channel Manager explanation -->
    <div class="row g-3 mt-2 text-center">
      <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center gap-2 p-3 rounded-3" style="background:rgba(13,110,253,.05);">
          <span style="font-size:1.4rem;">🔄</span>
          <div class="fw-semibold small">Real-Time Sync</div>
          <div class="text-muted" style="font-size:.78rem;">Availability and rates update instantly across all OTAs — no double bookings.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center gap-2 p-3 rounded-3" style="background:rgba(13,110,253,.05);">
          <span style="font-size:1.4rem;">📊</span>
          <div class="fw-semibold small">One Dashboard</div>
          <div class="text-muted" style="font-size:.78rem;">Manage all your channels from a single calendar. No more logging into each OTA separately.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center gap-2 p-3 rounded-3" style="background:rgba(13,110,253,.05);">
          <span style="font-size:1.4rem;">💰</span>
          <div class="fw-semibold small">Dynamic Pricing</div>
          <div class="text-muted" style="font-size:.78rem;">Set rate rules once. Roomnix pushes the right price to every channel automatically.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center gap-2 p-3 rounded-3" style="background:rgba(13,110,253,.05);">
          <span style="font-size:1.4rem;">⚡</span>
          <div class="fw-semibold small">Instant Setup</div>
          <div class="text-muted" style="font-size:.78rem;">Connect your first OTA in minutes. No technical skills required.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center mt-3">
      <a href="/channel-manager" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">Learn more about Channel Manager →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Feature Section -->
<section id="features" class="features airbnb-features py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
      <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light mb-2">
        What you get with Roomnix      </span>
      <h2 class="fw-bold mb-2">Features</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-0">Everything you need to manage your hotel effortlessly.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon calendar">
            <i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="feature-title">Booking Calendar</h5>
            <p class="feature-desc mb-0">Interactive drag-and-drop calendar to manage reservations with ease.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon booking">
            <i class="bi bi-cart-check"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="feature-title">Booking Engine</h5>
            <p class="feature-desc mb-0">Let guests book rooms directly from your website, with real-time availability.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon billing">
            <i class="bi bi-credit-card"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="feature-title">Billing & Payments</h5>
            <p class="feature-desc mb-0">Create folios, record cash/card/transfer payments, and keep totals clear in one place.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon channel">
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="feature-title">
              Channel Manager            </h5>
            <p class="feature-desc mb-0">Sync inventory and rates across OTAs like Booking.com, Airbnb, and Expedia.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon rates">
            <i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="feature-title">Rate Management</h5>
            <p class="feature-desc mb-0">Flexible pricing and availability tools.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon users">
            <i class="bi bi-person-gear"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="feature-title">User Roles</h5>
            <p class="feature-desc mb-0">Customizable access levels for staff and admins.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon website">
            <i class="bi bi-window"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h5 class="feature-title">Website Builder</h5>
            <p class="feature-desc mb-0">
              Create a hotel website in minutes - publish on a free Roomnix subdomain or connect your own domain.            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

