<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section id="faq" class="faq py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
      <span class="badge rounded-pill faq-badge mb-2">
        Answers to common questions      </span>
      <h2 class="fw-bold mb-2">FAQ</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-0">Everything you need to know before getting started with Roomnix.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
              <div class="accordion-item faq-item mb-3">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
            <button
              class="accordion-button  fw-semibold"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapse1"
              aria-expanded="true"
              aria-controls="collapse1"
            >
              💻 Is Roomnix cloud-based?            </button>
          </h2>
          <div
            id="collapse1"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
            data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"
          >
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
              Yes, Roomnix is 100% cloud-based. No installation required - just log in and manage your property from anywhere.            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
              <div class="accordion-item faq-item mb-3">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
            <button
              class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapse2"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="collapse2"
            >
              🔐 Is my property data secure?            </button>
          </h2>
          <div
            id="collapse2"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse "
            data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"
          >
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
              Absolutely. We use encrypted data storage and follow best practices to ensure all hotel and guest data is secure and GDPR/KVKK-compliant.            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
              <div class="accordion-item faq-item mb-3">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
            <button
              class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapse3"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="collapse3"
            >
              🔁 Can I migrate from my current system without losing data?            </button>
          </h2>
          <div
            id="collapse3"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse "
            data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"
          >
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
              Yes. We provide full migration assistance and securely transfer your rooms, bookings, rates and customer records. No downtime or data loss - we handle everything for you.            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
              <div class="accordion-item faq-item mb-3">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
            <button
              class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapse4"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="collapse4"
            >
              🎁 Is there a free trial or demo?            </button>
          </h2>
          <div
            id="collapse4"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse "
            data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"
          >
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
              Yes! You can try Roomnix immediately via our live demo. We also offer a one-year free pilot program for qualified hotels, with no credit card required.            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
              <div class="accordion-item faq-item mb-3">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
            <button
              class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapse5"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="collapse5"
            >
              🛠️ What kind of support does Roomnix offer?            </button>
          </h2>
          <div
            id="collapse5"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse "
            data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"
          >
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
              Our support team is available 7 days a week via WhatsApp, email and live assistance. We also provide onboarding support and training resources.            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
              <div class="accordion-item faq-item mb-3">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq6">
            <button
              class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold"
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#collapse6"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="collapse6"
            >
              🏕️ Does Roomnix support only hotels?            </button>
          </h2>
          <div
            id="collapse6"
            class="accordion-collapse collapse "
            data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion"
          >
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
              No. Roomnix supports hotels, hostels, villas, apartments, camping sites, glamping resorts, and caravan/RV parks. You can manage rooms, beds, units, or pitches depending on your property type.            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
          </div>
  </div>
</section>

