<script>
  window.lang = {"go_to_app":"Go to APP","hero_subtitle":"Minimal. Powerful. Cloud-based HMS.","try_demo":"Try Live Demo","subscribe_now":"Subscribe Now","features_title":"Features","features_desc":"Everything you need to manage your property effortlessly.","page_title":"Roomnix | Hotel Management System","features":"Features","features_subtitle":"Everything you need to manage your hotel effortlessly.","booking_calendar":"Booking Calendar","booking_calendar_desc":"Interactive drag-and-drop calendar to manage reservations with ease.","billing_payments":"Billing \u0026 Payments","billing_payments_desc":"Create folios, record cash\/card\/transfer payments, and keep totals clear in one place.","rate_management":"Rate Management","rate_management_desc":"Flexible pricing and availability tools.","user_roles":"User Roles","user_roles_desc":"Customizable access levels for staff and admins.","booking_engine":"Booking Engine","booking_engine_desc":"Let guests book rooms directly from your website, with real-time availability.","channel_manager":"Channel Manager","channel_manager_desc":"Sync inventory and rates across OTAs like Booking.com, Airbnb, and Expedia.","pricing":"Pricing","pricing_subtitle":"Flexible plans for every property size","monthly":"Monthly","yearly":"Yearly ","yearly_base":"Yearly","number_of_units":"Number of units","per_month":"\/month","per_year":"\/year","feature_hms":"Hotel Management System (HMS)","feature_booking_engine":"Booking Engine","select_base":"Select Base","most_popular":"Most Popular","feature_channel_manager":"Channel Manager","select_pro":"Select Pro","feature_all_from_pro":"All from Pro Plan","feature_identity_reporting":"Identity Reporting System","feature_payment_integration":"Payment Integration","feature_invoicing":"Invoicing System","feature_rms":"Revenue Management System (RMS)","select_premium":"Select Premium","trusted_heading":"Trusted by exceptional hotels, hostels, villas, apartments, and camping\/RV parks","trusted_desc":"Roomnix empowers modern hospitality with simplicity and power.","testimonial_1_title":"Neoss Boutique Hotel","testimonial_1_location":"Seferihisar, Türkiye","testimonial_1_quote":"Roomnix simplified our daily operations from day one. The calendar is intuitive, and the booking engine is incredibly smooth.","testimonial_2_title":"Satsuma Garden","testimonial_2_location":"Izmir, Turkey","testimonial_2_quote":"Choosing Roomnix was simple - it is free, fast to learn and already improves our daily operations. Support is responsive and we feel involved in the product’s evolution.","what_you_can_do_title":"What You Can Do with Roomnix","what_you_can_do_desc":"Powerful tools to simplify every aspect of hotel operations.","feature_calendar_title":"📅 HMS with Drag-and-Drop Calendar","feature_calendar_desc":"Easily manage check-ins, check-outs, and reservations in one visual interface.","feature_engine_title":"🌐 Integrated Booking Engine","feature_engine_desc":"Accept direct bookings with real-time availability and custom branding.","feature_engine_demo":"Try Booking Engine Demo","try_hms_demo":"Try HMS Demo","channel_manager_title":"🔗 Channel Manager","try_channel_demo":"Try Channel Manager Demo","faq_title":"FAQ","faq_subtitle":"Everything you need to know before getting started with Roomnix.","faq_q1":"💻 Is Roomnix cloud-based?","faq_q2":"🔐 Is my property data secure?","faq_q3":"🔁 Can I migrate from my current system without losing data?","faq_q4":"🎁 Is there a free trial or demo?","faq_q5":"🛠️ What kind of support does Roomnix offer?","faq_q6":"🏕️ Does Roomnix support only hotels?","faq_a1":"Yes, Roomnix is 100% cloud-based. No installation required - just log in and manage your property from anywhere.","faq_a2":"Absolutely. We use encrypted data storage and follow best practices to ensure all hotel and guest data is secure and GDPR\/KVKK-compliant.","faq_a3":"Yes. We provide full migration assistance and securely transfer your rooms, bookings, rates and customer records. No downtime or data loss - we handle everything for you.","faq_a4":"Yes! You can try Roomnix immediately via our live demo. We also offer a one-year free pilot program for qualified hotels, with no credit card required.","faq_a5":"Our support team is available 7 days a week via WhatsApp, email and live assistance. We also provide onboarding support and training resources.","faq_a6":"No. Roomnix supports hotels, hostels, villas, apartments, camping sites, glamping resorts, and caravan\/RV parks. You can manage rooms, beds, units, or pitches depending on your property type.","contact_title":"Contact Us","contact_text":"Want a custom quote or have questions? Contact us at","footer_text":"\u0026copy; 2025 Roomnix. All rights reserved.","complete_registration":"Complete Your Registration","plan":"Plan","full_name":"Full Name","property_name":"Property Name","country":"Country","select_country":"Select Country","city":"City","address":"Address","phone_number":"Phone Number","email":"Email","password":"Password","confirm_password":"Confirm Password","payment_method":"Payment Method","credit_card":"Credit Card","bank_transfer":"Bank Transfer","card_number":"Card Number","expiry_date":"Expiry Date","cvv":"CVV","card_holder":"Card Holder Name","bank_instructions":"Bank Transfer Instructions:","bank_mail":"After completing your subscription, you’ll receive an email with IBAN details and transfer instructions.","privacy_policy":"Privacy Policy","pre_information_form":"Pre-Information Form","distance_selling_contract":"Distance Selling Contract","confirm_and_pay":"Confirm \u0026 Pay","agree_terms":"By confirming your subscription, you agree to our:","room":"Room","confirm_only":"Confirm","pilot_no_payment":"No payment required for Pilot program.","referral_code_label":"Referral Code (optional)","referral_code_placeholder":"If another hotel referred you, enter their code here","referral_code_help":"If you were referred by a partner hotel, enter the code they gave you so both of you can earn extra free months.","error_missing_fields":"Please fill in all required fields.","error_password_mismatch":"Passwords do not match.","error_prepare_failed":"Failed to prepare the statement: ","error_bind_failed":"Failed to bind parameters: ","error_execution_failed":"Failed to execute the statement: ","error_admin_insert":"Failed to create admin user: ","iyzico_redirecting":"Redirecting to secure Iyzico payment...","iyzico_failed":"❌ Iyzico Payment Init Failed","iyzico_error":"Error:","iyzico_detail":"Detail:","missing_fields":"Missing or invalid fields","email_already_registered":"This email is already registered.","bank_transfer_subject":"Roomnix Bank Transfer Instructions","bank_transfer_greeting":"Dear","bank_transfer_thanks":"Thank you for registering for Roomnix.","bank_transfer_instruction":"To complete your subscription, please transfer the total amount of","bank_name":"Bank Name","account_holder":"Account Holder","iban":"IBAN","swift":"SWIFT\/BIC","currency_info_try":"Currency: TRY (₺)","currency_info_eur":"Currency: EUR (€)\nSWIFT\/BIC: EURBANKTRXXX\n*Ensure the transfer is sent in EUR via SEPA.","reference":"Reference","bank_transfer_note":"After completing the transfer, we will activate your account.","contact_us_note":"If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email.","best_regards":"Best regards","team_signature":"Roomnix Team","coming_soon":"Coming Soon","privacy_policy_full":"Roomnix (“we”, “our”, or “us”) respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you provide through our Hotel Management System (“HMS”). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and share information about hotels and their guests, and outlines your rights regarding that information.\n\n1. Information We Collect\nWe may collect and process the following types of information:\n\na) Hotel Information\nHotel name, address, country, and city\nContact information: email address, phone number\nBilling details: payment method, billing cycle, selected plan, VAT information (if applicable)\n\nb) User (Hotel Admin\/Staff) Information\nFull name\nEmail address\nLogin credentials (passwords are securely hashed)\nRole within the system (Admin, Staff, etc.)\n\nc) Guest Information\nStored by the hotel within the HMS:\nFull name\nContact details (email, phone, address)\nNational ID or passport number (where applicable)\nCheck-in and check-out dates\nBooking history and preferences\n\n2. How We Use Your Information\nWe use collected information for the following purposes:\nTo register and manage hotel accounts\nTo provide, maintain, and improve the HMS services\nTo process billing and payment operations securely\nTo store guest data on behalf of hotels for reservation and operational purposes\nTo support legal compliance, including applicable hospitality regulations\nTo send administrative or system-related notifications\n\n3. Data Sharing \u0026 Third-Party Access\nWe do not sell or rent personal information to third parties.\nWe may share hotel or guest information with trusted third-party service providers under the following conditions:\nPayment processors (e.g., Stripe, Iyzico) for secure transactions\nCloud hosting or infrastructure providers (for data storage and access)\nLegal authorities, only when required by law or valid legal requests\nAll third parties are contractually obligated to keep the data confidential and use it only for the specified purpose.\n\n4. Data Security\nWe implement industry-standard security measures to protect personal data:\nSSL\/TLS encryption for all data transmission\nPasswords hashed with strong algorithms (e.g., BCRYPT)\nRole-based access control for staff and hotel users\nDaily database backups\nSecure firewalls and DDoS protection\n\n5. Data Retention\nWe retain hotel and guest data for as long as the hotel account is active or as needed to fulfill our obligations. Upon termination of service, data will be deleted or anonymized within 60 days unless legally required to retain it longer.\n\n6. Your Rights\nYou may exercise the following rights by contacting us:\nAccess, update, or delete personal data\nExport guest data (hotels only)\nRequest restriction of processing\nWithdraw consent at any time (e.g., for marketing communications)\n\n7. Cookies and Tracking\nWe may use cookies and similar technologies to:\nMaintain user sessions\nAnalyze website usage (via tools like Google Analytics)\nImprove user experience\nYou can manage cookie preferences through your browser settings.\n\n8. International Data Transfers\nIf you are located outside the hosting region (e.g., the EU or Turkey), your data may be transferred to and processed in jurisdictions with different data protection laws. We ensure adequate protection through contractual clauses or other lawful mechanisms.\n\n9. Children’s Privacy\nOur HMS is not intended for use by individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect data from children.\n\n10. Changes to This Policy\nWe reserve the right to update this policy at any time. When we do, we will revise the “Last Updated” date at the top. Significant changes will be communicated via email or system notification.\n\n11. Contact Us\nIf you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:\n📧 privacy@roomnix.com\n📍 Gülbahçe Mah. İçmeler Cad. 14\/2 B06 Urla İzmir Turkey\n📞 +90 850 840 2160","pre_info_full":"Pre-Contractual Information Form\n(in accordance with EU Directive 2011\/83\/EU on Consumer Rights)\n\nCompany Name: Apposia Technology A.S\nAddress: Gülbahçe Mah. İçmeler Cad. No:14\/2 B06 Urla Izmir\nPhone: +90 850 840 2160\nEmail: info@roomnix.com\nWebsite: https:\/\/roomnix.com\n\n1. Subject of the Contract\nThis pre-contractual form is intended to inform consumers about their rights and obligations prior to the conclusion of a distance contract, as defined by EU Directive 2011\/83\/EU. Roomnix provides cloud-based Hotel Management Software as a Service (SaaS).\n\n2. Description of Services\nHotel Management System (HMS)\nOnline Booking Engine\nChannel Manager (OTA Integrations)\nGuest and Staff Management\nRate and Revenue Tools\nThe scope and availability of services vary depending on the selected subscription plan and number of rooms.\n\n3. Price and Payment Terms\nSubscription prices are calculated based on the selected plan (Base or Pro) and number of rooms.\nPrices are shown in EUR, inclusive of applicable VAT.\nPayment options include bank transfer and credit card.\nSubscription cycle: monthly or yearly, as selected during checkout.\nThe total price and renewal terms are clearly presented before final confirmation.\n\n4. Delivery \u0026 Access\nServices are delivered digitally, without physical shipment.\nUpon successful payment, the customer gains immediate access to the Roomnix dashboard.\nAccount credentials are generated during registration.\n\n5. Right of Withdrawal\nUnder Article 16(m) of EU Directive 2011\/83\/EU:\nThe right of withdrawal does not apply to contracts for the supply of digital content which is not supplied on a tangible medium if the performance has begun with the consumer’s prior express consent and with the acknowledgment that they thereby lose their right of withdrawal.\nIf the customer has not started using the service, they may withdraw within 14 days.\nTo exercise the right of withdrawal, a clear written request must be sent to support@roomnix.com.\n\n6. Data Protection (GDPR)\nRoomnix is committed to protecting personal data in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR).\nData such as hotel name, contact details, and guest information are collected solely for service delivery and legal compliance.\nUsers have the right to access, rectify, and request deletion of their data at any time.\nFull details are available in our Privacy Policy.\n\n7. Complaint and Dispute Resolution\nConsumers may submit complaints via email to support@roomnix.com.\nIn case of unresolved disputes, customers in the EU may use the Online Dispute Resolution (ODR) platform:\n🔗 https:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/consumers\/odr\n\n8. Confirmation\nBy checking the box and submitting your order, you confirm:\nYou have read and understood this Pre-Contractual Information Form.\nYou agree to waive your right of withdrawal upon activation of the digital service.","distance_contract_full":"(Applicable for Digital Services – EU Consumer Rights Compliant)\n\nThis Distance Selling Contract (“Contract”) is entered into between:\n\nService Provider:\nApposia Technology A.S\nGülbahçe Mah. İçmeler Cad. No: 14\/2 B06 Urla İzmir Turkey\nEmail: info@roomnix.com\nWebsite: https:\/\/roomnix.com\n(hereinafter referred to as the \u0022Provider\u0022)\n\nand\n\nCustomer:\nThe individual or legal entity completing the Roomnix online checkout form.\n(hereinafter referred to as the \u0022Customer\u0022)\n\n1. Subject of the Contract\nThe subject of this contract is the provision of digital software services, specifically access to the Roomnix Hotel Management System (HMS) via the internet, as per the Customer’s selected subscription plan.\n\n2. Nature of the Service\nThe services provided by Roomnix are fully digital and include:\n\n• Hotel and reservation management\n• Channel integration (OTAs)\n• Booking engine\n• Rate and revenue management\n• Staff and guest record keeping\n\nThere is no physical delivery. Access is granted digitally after successful registration and payment.\n\n3. Contract Formation\nThis contract becomes effective when the Customer:\n• Completes the checkout form\n• Accepts the terms and conditions\n• Clicks the Confirm and Pay button\n\nUpon acceptance, the Customer receives email confirmation, and services are provisioned immediately.\n\n4. Duration and Renewal\nThe contract is valid for the selected subscription period (monthly or yearly).\nUnless cancelled, the contract is automatically renewed at the end of the period under the same terms.\n\n5. Price and Payment\nSubscription fees are calculated based on the selected plan and number of rooms.\nPrices include applicable VAT and are clearly displayed before checkout.\nPayment methods: credit card or bank transfer.\nFull payment is required before services become active.\n\n6. Right of Withdrawal (Article 16(m) of Directive 2011\/83\/EU)\nThe Customer acknowledges and agrees that the right of withdrawal does not apply once digital content delivery has begun with their express consent.\nBy confirming payment, the Customer waives the right to cancel after the account is activated.\n\n7. Liability\nRoomnix shall not be held liable for:\n• Downtime or access issues due to third-party infrastructure\n• Customer’s misuse of the system\n• Loss of data due to actions outside Roomnix\u0027s control\n\n8. Personal Data \u0026 GDPR Compliance\nRoomnix collects and processes Customer and guest data in compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).\nDetails on data collection, usage, and user rights are specified in the Privacy Policy.\n\n9. Complaint and Dispute Resolution\nComplaints may be directed to: support@roomnix.com\nIn the event of unresolved disputes, the Customer may use the EU Online Dispute Resolution (ODR) platform:\n🔗 https:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/consumers\/odr\n\n10. Governing Law\nThis contract shall be governed by the laws of the country where the Customer resides, as per EU consumer protection directives.\n\n11. Acceptance\nBy proceeding with payment and using the Roomnix system, the Customer confirms:\n✅ I have read and agree to the terms of this Distance Selling Contract.","hero_title_airbnb":"The simplest way to manage your property.","hero_subtitle_airbnb":"Roomnix helps hotels, hostels, villas \u0026 apartments, and camping\/RV parks run smoothly with an intuitive calendar, fast check-in, online bookings, and effortless billing.","hero_try_demo_now":"Try Live Demo","hero_see_features":"See Features","what_you_can_do_badge":"Start today with Roomnix","faq_badge":"Answers to common questions","whatsapp_chat_title":"Chat with us","whatsapp_chat_subtitle":"Instant support","features_badge":"What you get with Roomnix","back_to_pricing":"Back to pricing","checkout_title":"Complete your Roomnix subscription","checkout_subtitle":"Tell us a bit about your property and confirm your payment method.","your_plan":"Your plan","rooms":"rooms","checkout_price_note":"Final price may vary with local taxes.","secure_checkout":"Secure checkout powered by Roomnix.","checkout_badge":"Finish setting up your account","trust_channels_badge":"Channel partners","trust_channels_more":"+50 more","cm_strip_feat1_title":"Real-Time Sync","cm_strip_feat1_desc":"Availability and rates update instantly across all OTAs — no double bookings.","cm_strip_feat2_title":"One Dashboard","cm_strip_feat2_desc":"Manage all your channels from a single calendar. No more logging into each OTA separately.","cm_strip_feat3_title":"Dynamic Pricing","cm_strip_feat3_desc":"Set rate rules once. Roomnix pushes the right price to every channel automatically.","cm_strip_feat4_title":"Instant Setup","cm_strip_feat4_desc":"Connect your first OTA in minutes. No technical skills required.","cm_strip_learn_more":"Learn more about Channel Manager →","trust_security_gdpr_title":"Secure \u0026 GDPR \/ KVKK compliant","trust_security_gdpr_desc":"Built for EU privacy standards and hotel data protection.","trust_security_encrypt_title":"Encrypted data","trust_security_encrypt_desc":"All data encrypted in transit (HTTPS) and at rest.","pricing_room_based":"Inventory-based pricing","pricing_pay_active":"Pay only for active rooms","pricing_cancel_anytime":"Cancel anytime - no contract","pricing_migration":"Migration support included","why_hotels_choose":"Why properties choose Roomnix","why_hotels_choose_title":"We solve real property management problems","why_hotels_choose_sub":"Focus on operations - let Roomnix handle the rest.","stop_overbookings":"Stop overbookings","easy_planning":"Easy drag \u0026 drop planning","faster_checkin":"Faster check-in process","fewer_mistakes":"Fewer operational mistakes","e_invoice":"E-invoicing \u0026 e-archive integration","accounting":"Accounting-friendly reports","mobile_ui":"Mobile-friendly dashboard","no_training":"No training required for staff","who_for_badge":"Who is Roomnix for?","who_for_title":"Designed for all types of small and medium-sized properties","who_for_sub":"Whether you manage rooms, dorm beds, villas, apartments, or camping pitches, Roomnix is built for your property.","for_boutique":"Boutique Hotels","for_apart":"Apart Hotels \u0026 Bungalows","for_beach":"Beach Hotels","for_guest":"Guesthouses","for_hostel":"Hostels","for_pension":"Pensions","switching_badge":"Switching from another PMS?","switching_title":"Already using another system?","switching_sub":"We handle the migration for you - no downtime, no data loss.","switch_free_migration":"Free migration","switch_import":"Import your rooms \u0026 bookings","switch_setup":"1-day setup","switch_onboarding":"Dedicated onboarding","switch_whatsapp":"WhatsApp support","nav_channels":"Partners","nav_features":"Features","nav_pain_points":"Why Roomnix","nav_who_for":"Who it’s for","nav_testimonials":"Testimonials","nav_pricing":"Pricing","nav_demo":"Demo","nav_faq":"FAQ","standard_commission_label":"Commission rate","standard_commission_note":"Per booking via Roomnix Booking Engine.","standard_commission_detail":"If you dont want to use the Booking Engine, the PMS remains completely free.","follow_us":"Follow us","registration_successful":"🎉 Registration Successful!","registration_success_subtitle":"Your Roomnix PMS account is now active.","registration_success_line1":"Your Roomnix account has been created. Pricing depends on your selected plan and region.","registration_success_line2":"You can now start setting up your hotel in Roomnix.","registration_hotel_label":"Hotel","registration_back_home":"Back to Roomnix homepage","open_roomnix_app":"Open Roomnix App","registration_email_soon_title":"Check your email","registration_email_soon_text":"You will receive an email shortly with the next steps to access your Roomnix account.","base_no_payment":"You only pay commission for each booking (if Booking Engine is used)","trusted_badge":"Trusted by real properties","contact_badge":"Let’s talk","testimonial_1_stay_type":"Boutique hotel, coastal region","testimonial_2_stay_type":"Beachside hotel","early_access":"Early access offer. Available for a short period","pro_plan_note":"Estimated price based on room count.","pro_plan_price_note":"Example above assumes $2.5 per room \/ month for 10 rooms.","estimated_price_note":"Estimated price based on room count.","example_assumes":"Example above assumes $1.5 per room \/ month for 10 rooms.","free":"Free","trial_30_days_note":"You won’t be charged today. Your 15-day free trial starts when you complete this form.","trial_no_payment":"No payment required today. Your 15-day free trial starts now.","start_trial":"Start 15-day trial","trial_badge":"15-day free trial","recommended_badge":"Recommended","trial_gh_base_note":"First 15 days free. No payment today – you can cancel during the trial.","how_did_you_find_us":"How did you hear about Roomnix?","select_option":"Select an option","how_found_google":"Google search","how_found_instagram":"Instagram","how_found_linkedin":"LinkedIn","how_found_friend":"Recommendation from another hotel","how_found_event":"Event \/ fair \/ meetup","how_found_other":"Other","current_pms_label":"Which PMS \/ system do you currently use?","current_pms_placeholder":"e.g. none, Little Hotelier, SabeeApp, other...","website_builder_title":"Website Builder","website_builder_desc_public":"Create a hotel website in minutes - publish on a free Roomnix subdomain or connect your own domain.","feature_website_builder":"Website Builder","see_sample_website":"See a sample website","whatsapp_label":"WhatsApp Number (with country code)","whatsapp_placeholder":"+90 5xx xxx xx xx","instagram_label":"Instagram Username","instagram_placeholder":"yourhotel","whatsapp_or_instagram_help":"Please provide at least a WhatsApp number or Instagram username so we can verify your hotel.","whatsapp_or_instagram_required":"Please enter at least a WhatsApp number or an Instagram username.","whatsapp_invalid":"Invalid WhatsApp number format.","instagram_invalid":"Invalid Instagram username format.","inventory_count_label":"Number of units","inventory_count_hint":"Rooms for hotels, beds for hostels, units for apartments\/villas, pitches for camping.","property_type_setup_note":"You will choose your property type (hotel, hostel, apartment, camping) and inventory settings inside the app after you sign up.","property_type":"Property type","property_type_hint":"This helps us configure Roomnix for your inventory (rooms, beds, units, or pitches).","number_of_rooms":"Number of rooms","number_of_beds":"Number of beds","number_of_pitches":"Number of pitches","seo_usecases_badge":"Use cases","seo_usecases_title":"Property management for every inventory type","seo_usecases_subtitle":"Roomnix works for rooms, dorm beds, units and pitches — with one calendar and one workflow.","seo_hotels_title":"Hotel PMS","seo_hotels_desc":"Manage rooms with a drag \u0026 drop calendar, faster check-in, invoicing, payments and reports. Perfect for boutique hotels and small\/medium properties.","seo_hostels_title":"Hostel PMS (Dorm beds)","seo_hostels_desc":"Sell dorm beds or private rooms, control bed availability, and manage allocations per date. Ideal for hostels with mixed inventory.","seo_villas_title":"Villa \u0026 Apartment PMS","seo_villas_desc":"Manage units, seasonal pricing, minimum stays and guest details. Great for apartments, apart hotels, villas and vacation rentals.","seo_camping_title":"Camping \u0026 RV Park PMS (Pitches\/Sites)","seo_camping_desc":"Manage pitches\/sites, availability, guest check-ins and payments — designed for camping, glamping, caravan and RV parks.","seo_usecases_note":"Tip: Create dedicated pages later (e.g., \/hotel-pms, \/hostel-pms) to rank even faster.","back_home":"Back","see_pricing":"See pricing","hotel_pms_h1":"Hotel PMS Software","hotel_pms_lead":"Cloud hotel PMS with calendar, check-in\/out, invoicing, payments, reporting and booking engine.","hotel_pms_features_title":"Key features","hotel_pms_feat_1":"Drag \u0026 drop booking calendar","hotel_pms_feat_2":"Fast check-in \/ check-out","hotel_pms_feat_3":"Invoices, payments and folios","hotel_pms_feat_4":"Accounting-friendly reports","hotel_pms_feat_5":"Online booking engine","hotel_pms_for_title":"Built for","hotel_pms_for_desc":"Boutique hotels, small and medium-sized hotels, city hotels and coastal properties that need speed and control.","hostel_pms_h1":"Hostel PMS (Dorm Beds)","hostel_pms_lead":"Hostel PMS for dorm beds and private rooms: control bed availability, allocations, check-ins and payments.","hostel_pms_features_title":"Key features","hostel_pms_feat_1":"Dorm beds + private rooms in one calendar","hostel_pms_feat_2":"Bed availability control per date","hostel_pms_feat_3":"Faster check-in \/ guest registration","hostel_pms_feat_4":"Payments, folios and reports","hostel_pms_feat_5":"Booking engine ready (commission only if used)","hostel_pms_for_title":"Built for","hostel_pms_for_desc":"Hostels with dorms, mixed room types, seasonal occupancy and frequent turnarounds.","camping_pms_h1":"Camping \u0026 RV Park PMS","camping_pms_lead":"Manage pitches\/sites with availability, check-ins, payments and reporting. Built for camping, glamping and RV parks.","camping_pms_features_title":"Key features","camping_pms_feat_1":"Pitches\/Sites inventory management","camping_pms_feat_2":"Availability control per date","camping_pms_feat_3":"Fast check-in and payment tracking","camping_pms_feat_4":"Seasonal pricing and minimum stays","camping_pms_feat_5":"Booking engine ready","camping_pms_for_title":"Built for","camping_pms_for_des