k workflows, reservation management, booking engines, direct booking strategy, hotel websites, guest WiFi and reporting.","blog_about_p2":"We also publish content for independent hotels, small properties and teams that want to simplify operations, improve the guest journey and build more control over pricing, inventory and online sales.","blog_about_p3":"As the Roomnix blog grows, this section will include more guides about hotel technology, hospitality operations in Turkey, direct reservation growth and practical software decisions for modern accommodation businesses.","blog_category_hotel_management":"Hotel Management","blog_category_hotel_management_desc":"Articles about hotel PMS software, front desk workflows, reservations, guests and daily property management operations.","blog_category_direct_bookings":"Direct Bookings","blog_category_direct_bookings_desc":"Guides about booking engines, hotel websites, conversion, direct reservations and reducing OTA dependency.","blog_category_hotel_websites":"Hotel Websites","blog_category_hotel_websites_desc":"Content about hotel websites, booking journeys, website performance and direct booking growth.","blog_category_hotel_technology":"Hotel Technology","blog_category_hotel_technology_desc":"Hospitality technology articles covering hotel systems, operations tools, automation and digital workflows.","blog_category_hotel_reports":"Reports \u0026 Revenue","blog_category_hotel_reports_desc":"Articles about hotel reports, revenue management, financial tracking, performance analytics and business insights.","blog_category_hotel_operations":"Hotel Operations","blog_category_hotel_operations_desc":"Articles about hotel operations, daily workflows, staff management, guest experience and operational efficiency.","blog_category_comparisons":"Comparisons","blog_category_comparisons_desc":"Comparison articles about hotel PMS software, booking engines, and hospitality technology tools.","blog_category_page_title":"%s Articles | Roomnix Blog","blog_category_page_desc":"Browse Roomnix blog articles in the %s category. %s","blog_category_intro_secondary":"Browse practical hospitality articles in this category and explore more content about hotel software, operations, guest experience and direct booking growth.","blog_no_articles_title":"No articles yet in this category","blog_no_articles_desc":"This category page is ready, but no published blog posts are available here yet.","blog_back_to_blog":"Back to blog","blog_category_about_title":"About this category","blog_category_about_p1":"Roomnix category pages group together related hospitality articles so hotels can more easily find practical content by topic, from property management systems to direct booking strategy and hotel operations.","blog_category_about_p2":"As the Roomnix blog grows, each category will continue to expand with more useful articles, guides and software insights for accommodation businesses.","blog_translation_fallback_notice":"This article is currently shown in English because the selected language version is not available yet.","blog_related_articles":"Related articles","blog_main_products_title":"Explore main Roomnix products","blog_main_products_desc":"Looking beyond this article? Explore the main Roomnix tools for hotel operations, direct bookings and hotel websites.","blog_related_guides_title":"More blog guides","blog_related_guides_desc":"Continue reading related Roomnix articles about hotel software, booking engines and direct bookings.","tools_badge":"Free Tools","tools_index_title":"Hotel Tools \u0026 Calculators | Roomnix","tools_index_desc":"Use free hotel tools and calculators for OTA commissions, revenue, RevPAR, occupancy, and direct booking performance.","tools_index_h1":"Hotel Tools \u0026 Calculators","tools_index_intro":"Explore free hotel calculators and practical tools for pricing, revenue, occupancy, direct bookings, and OTA costs.","tools_index_intro_secondary":"These tools are designed for independent hotels, small properties, and accommodation businesses that want to make better operational and commercial decisions.","tools_popular_title":"Popular hotel tools","tools_open_tool":"Open tool","tools_about_title":"Why hotel tools matter","tools_about_p1":"Hotels make pricing, distribution, and revenue decisions every day. Simple calculators can help teams understand commission costs, occupancy performance, direct booking impact, and revenue potential more clearly.","tools_about_p2":"Roomnix tools are designed to support practical decision-making for hotels that want to improve direct bookings, reduce OTA dependency, and manage operations more efficiently.","tools_cta_title":"Explore Roomnix products","tools_cta_desc":"Looking beyond calculators? Explore the main Roomnix tools for hotel operations, direct bookings, and hotel websites.","tool_ota_commission_title":"OTA Commission Calculator","tool_ota_commission_desc":"Estimate how much revenue your hotel loses to OTA commissions per booking, per month, or per year.","tool_hotel_revenue_title":"Hotel Revenue Calculator","tool_hotel_revenue_desc":"Estimate monthly and yearly hotel revenue based on room count, ADR, and occupancy.","tool_revpar_title":"RevPAR Calculator","tool_revpar_desc":"Calculate RevPAR quickly using ADR and occupancy data for your property.","tool_occupancy_title":"Occupancy Calculator","tool_occupancy_desc":"Measure hotel occupancy performance for a period using sold room nights and available inventory.","cm_seo_title":"Hotel Channel Manager | Roomnix","cm_seo_desc":"Roomnix Channel Manager connects your property to Booking.com, Airbnb, Expedia, Google Hotel Ads, Agoda and more — syncing rates and availability in real time.","cm_badge":"Roomnix Channel Manager","cm_h1":"Hotel Channel Manager — Connect to 50+ OTAs","cm_intro":"Sync your rates, availability and bookings across Booking.com, Airbnb, Expedia, Google Hotel Ads, Agoda and hundreds more — all from your Roomnix PMS.","cm_channels_connected":"Channels Connected","cm_cta_primary":"Get Pro Plan","cm_cta_title":"Ready to connect your property to every major OTA?","cm_cta_desc":"Start for free on the Standard Plan and upgrade to Pro when you\u0027re ready to connect your channels.","cm_features_title":"Everything you need to manage your channels","cm_features_sub":"One dashboard. All channels. Zero overbookings.","cm_feature_1_title":"Two-Way Sync","cm_feature_1_desc":"Availability and rates flow automatically between Roomnix and all connected OTAs — no manual updates needed.","cm_feature_2_title":"Real-Time Availability","cm_feature_2_desc":"Every booking from any channel instantly updates your Roomnix calendar, preventing overbookings.","cm_feature_3_title":"Rate Management","cm_feature_3_desc":"Set different rates per channel, apply promotions and manage minimum stays from one place.","cm_feature_4_title":"50+ Channels","cm_feature_4_desc":"Connect to Booking.com, Airbnb, Expedia, Google Hotel Ads, Agoda, TripAdvisor, VRBO, Hostelworld and hundreds more.","cm_feature_5_title":"Instant Setup","cm_feature_5_desc":"Connect your first OTA in minutes. No technical knowledge required.","cm_feature_6_title":"Overbooking Protection","cm_feature_6_desc":"Centralized inventory management ensures you never accidentally sell the same room twice.","cm_ota_directory_badge":"Supported channels","cm_ota_directory_title":"Connect to the world\u0027s leading booking platforms","cm_ota_directory_sub":"Roomnix Channel Manager supports 50+ channels. Here are the most popular ones.","cm_ota_type_major":"Major OTA","cm_ota_type_meta":"Metasearch","cm_ota_type_vacation":"Vacation Rental","cm_ota_type_hostel":"Hostel","cm_ota_booking_desc":"The world\u0027s largest accommodation platform. Connect your property to millions of global travelers.","cm_ota_airbnb_desc":"Reach guests looking for unique stays worldwide. Full two-way sync with Airbnb listings.","cm_ota_expedia_desc":"Connect to Expedia Group\u0027s global network including Hotels.com and VRBO brands.","cm_ota_google_desc":"Show your live rates and availability directly in Google Search and Maps — one of the highest-intent booking surfaces.","cm_ota_agoda_desc":"Top OTA in Asia Pacific markets. Reach travelers from China, Japan, South Korea, Thailand and beyond.","cm_ota_tripadvisor_desc":"Appear on TripAdvisor\u0027s hotel search with live rates. Leverage the world\u0027s largest travel review platform.","cm_ota_hotelscom_desc":"Part of the Expedia Group. Popular with loyalty program members who book frequently.","cm_ota_vrbo_desc":"Ideal for vacation rentals, apartments, villas and holiday homes. Part of the Expedia Group.","cm_ota_hostelworld_desc":"The leading OTA for hostels. Connect dorm beds, private rooms and mixed inventory.","cm_ota_more_title":"40+ More Channels","cm_ota_more_desc":"Including Orbitz, HotelsCombined, Priceline, Ctrip, Traveloka, Despegar, loveholidays, HRS, and hundreds of regional OTAs.","cm_how_title":"How the Channel Manager works","cm_how_sub":"A simple, automated workflow that keeps all your channels in sync.","cm_step_1_title":"1. Connect","cm_step_1_desc":"Link your Roomnix account to your OTA extranets. Most channels connect in minutes.","cm_step_2_title":"2. Configure","cm_step_2_desc":"Map your room types and rate plans to each channel. Set pricing rules and restrictions.","cm_step_3_title":"3. Sync","cm_step_3_desc":"Roomnix automatically pushes availability and rates to all channels in real time.","cm_step_4_title":"4. Receive","cm_step_4_desc":"Bookings from any channel flow directly into your Roomnix PMS calendar.","cm_faq_intro":"Everything you need to know about the Roomnix Channel Manager.","cm_faq_1_q":"Which OTAs does the Roomnix Channel Manager support?","cm_faq_1_a":"Roomnix Channel Manager connects to 50+ channels including Booking.com, Airbnb, Expedia, Google Hotel Ads, Agoda, TripAdvisor, Hotels.com, VRBO, Hostelworld and many more regional and niche platforms.","cm_faq_2_q":"Will it prevent overbookings?","cm_faq_2_a":"Yes. All channels share one central inventory in your Roomnix PMS. When a room is booked on any channel it is instantly removed from availability on all others.","cm_faq_3_q":"Can I set different prices per channel?","cm_faq_3_a":"Yes. Rate plans are managed in Roomnix and you can assign different rates, restrictions and promotions to each connected channel.","cm_faq_4_q":"Is the Channel Manager included in the free plan?","cm_faq_4_a":"Channel Manager is part of the Pro Plan. You can explore Roomnix for free on the Standard Plan and upgrade to Pro when ready.","cm_faq_5_q":"How long does setup take?","cm_faq_5_a":"Most properties connect their first channel within minutes. Our onboarding team is available to help if needed."};
